908:2 & \(U \xrightarrow{d_1+\frac{s\gamma}{1+s}} \emptyset\) & $d_1 = 1.0$, $s = 0.1$, $\gamma = 1.0$ \\
909:3 & \(\emptyset \xrightarrow{\eta\left(\alpha_2 + \frac{\beta_2K_2^3}{K_2^3+U^3}\right)} V\) & $\eta = 1.0$, $\alpha_2 = 20$, $\beta_2 = 400$, $K_2 = 100$ \\
